{"id":"110172","name":"Sprout of Life","type":"Material","sub_type":"TracePath","rarity":3,"icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/item/110172.png","come_from":["Calyx (Backwater Pass)","Omni-Synthesizer — Material Synthesis","Embers Exchange","Omni-Synthesizer — Material Exchange"],"category":"Trace Material","desc":"A young sprout emerging from the Seed of Abundance. Used to level up Traces moderately for Abundance characters.","lore":"Radiating warmth, life and growth flourish around the place where it sinks its roots. Barren wastelands turn into luscious grass fields, withered plants rejuvenate and blossom, and springs burst through the ground to moisten the land.\nAs you get closer to it, your muscles and bones twitch and propagate with an unbearable itch.\n\n\"Life is unfailing where the soul abounds.\"","usedBy":{"characters":[{"id":1211,"name":"Bailu","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1211.png"},{"id":1217,"name":"Huohuo","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1217.png"},{"id":1203,"name":"Luocha","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1203.png"},{"id":1110,"name":"Lynx","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1110.png"},{"id":1105,"name":"Natasha","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1105.png"}],"lightCones":[{"id":57043983,"name":"Cornucopia","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/light_cone/20001.png"},{"id":2059763004,"name":"Echoes of the Coffin","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/light_cone/23008.png"},{"id":1483224622,"name":"Fine Fruit","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/light_cone/20008.png"},{"id":-1447933876,"name":"Hey, Over Here","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar